&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS/MA or BS/BA + 3-10 years of full-time experience exclusive of internships in Business Intelligence Engineering, Data Analyst, and Business Analyst roles&lt;/li&gt;
